> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏜 Build your army with a mix of <strong>core units</strong>, specialized <strong>support</strong> troops, and <strong>elite</strong> special units, each customizable with level-ups and unique <strong>abilities</strong> to enhance their battlefield prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=★=  From <strong>Rommel’s Afrika Korps </strong>to <strong>Montgomery’s Desert Rats</strong>, lead iconic forces through dynamic campaigns, leveraging strategy, resource management, and tactical cunning to outmaneuver your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rewrite history or hold the line? The deserts of Africa await your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076070/extras/0c2ef3b7ae2fff97b264efc745292216.avif?t=1781712714\" width=800 height=172 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛠 Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Italy, Wehrmacht, Commonwealth, or USA</strong> in historically inspired campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across stunning desert maps, from Syria’s rugged terrains to Tunisia’s coastal strongholds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 x Historical Missions – Faithfully recreated battles from the North African theater, featuring intense combined arms combat with authentic Axis &amp; Allies factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 x Sandbox Scenarios (available from Day 1) – Complete freedom to choose your side, era (1939–1945), and custom weapons loadouts for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Game Voice Narration in English, immersing you in the story of the desert war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Trees for every unit type – upgrade and specialize your forces as you progress.</p></li><li><p 